{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"745157935138865152","content":".\nScene is goose holding up a elementary schoolbook (which is floating and rotating).\n*bum bUM BAHH*\nGoose got ‘reading/writing skills’! (and has a few feathers out of place and is lowkey crying)","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:48:04.930000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746274412004769854","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"745157935138865152","content":".\nGoose thanks Florian for the lessons and sends him off with a goodie bag and a note. They return home to prepare before their errands. They walk out with a flat cap (irish hat/Jacksepticeye’s hat) and a satchel of boxes.","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:48:43.155000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746274572332040212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"745157935138865152","content":".\nThey stop in <#739055562540449915>  and honks and are delighted to see <@!436232470242000916>  and Arthur. A quick hug before Percival drops the bombshell “I HAVE A DAUGHTER”. Feathers fly as Goose flaps their wings out of excitement. When Perci says she was in London, Goose immediately invites themselves to come along. Not only to support Perci but to re-experience traveling and London, now as a new Goose. \n.\nThey spend some time, talking about this or that, doing some catching up. Goose lets Perci know they wont take offense if he took the “and Honks” part out, saying how they never really helped in the first place. But he reassures Percival that they are still near and dear to thier heart. Before Goose forgets they place down a goodie bag wrapped with a red ribbon and a note. Not long until the bag was open and the treats were consumed. \n.\nArthur was enjoying himself, but Goose warned him with their lesson with overindulgence. Hence why they turned down Perci when he broke a cookie in half and offered. Of course, Percival is busy as all heck, and has to go solve another mystery. Goose says their goodbyes and run off with their errands.","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:50:11.261000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-21T07:50:45.250000Z","id":"746274941875257376","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"745157935138865152","content":".\nA quick flight over to the orphanage, except, this time with stealth. With a 12+6 roll, Goose successfully sneak a parcel full of goodies and one with children books with a somewhat legible note\n```Mr. Duck is busy today, but be good children and they will come back. \nUntil then, try doing some story time yourself, and Mr. Duck will be amazed```","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:51:21.141000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746275234973352016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"745157935138865152","content":".\nGoose flies from house to house, leaving a goodie bag tied with a red ribbon and a note. As they fly around Goose bumps into <@!260820438026813440> . Which is convenient, as Web tells Goose threat they can cultivate a long term customizable yeast farm. Goose looks as clueless as ever. Thankfully, Web explains what a yeast farm is and it’s many uses. Goose thinks on it and decides to give it a try, but would like to start small. Web agrees, but before she leaves Goose hands them a goodie bag “For you and Baeshra” Goose adds. They part ways but not before Web reminds them, they’ll happily help out when needed.","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:51:44.525000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-21T07:51:52.087000Z","id":"746275333053087825","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"745157935138865152","content":".\nGoose heads back home, crack a few knuckles and goes buck wild in preparing some things.\n(just in Goose’s downtime for today, they are just experimenting and working on this one thing)","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:52:12.917000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746275452137635871","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"745157935138865152","content":"After all the baking and perfecting their secret ingredient, Goose sets up the menu board, ready for the opening. After clapping their hands they look at their menu.","created_at":"2020-08-21T08:02:39.607000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746278080666009653","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"745157935138865152","content":"``` **~Menu~**\nBread* - 1 gp\nCrepe* - 2 gp\nMeat Crepe - 8 gp\nMadeline*  - 5 gp\nMacaron* - 7 gp\nCookie (chocolate chip/sugar/plain) - 3 gp\n\n*Toppings/variants available for this selection; +4 gp for each toppings\nChocolate\nOrange\nStrawberry\nBlueberries\nMixed berries\n\n**~GOLDEN (made with Sandi berries)~**\nGolden Macarons (+10hp) - 100 gp \n(available: 2 per day, will expire after 24 hrs after purchase) ```","created_at":"2020-08-21T08:02:41.747000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-21T09:12:47.232000Z","id":"746278089641951253","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
